			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				365,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Common): Add IPC channels for inline completions, tree view, and auth validation\n\nExtend the `DefineChannels!` registry in `Source/IPC/Channel.rs` with three groups of new IPC channels:\n\n- **Inline completions** — `LanguageProvideInlineCompletions` opens a channel for the language service to stream inline (ghost text) completions from the extension host to the editor, a prerequisite for code suggestion features.\n\n- **Tree view** — Six channels (`TreeGetChildren`, `TreeReveal`, `TreeSelectionChanged`, `TreeCollapseElement`, `TreeExpandElement`, `TreeVisibilityChanged`) expose the full tree view lifecycle to Wind/Sky, enabling interactive tree widget implementations (file explorer, outline) over IPC.\n\n- **Auth validation** — `AuthValidateToken` adds a server-side token validation channel alongside the existing `AuthGetSessions`, `AuthCreateSession`, and `AuthRemoveSession`, completing the authentication CRUD contract.\n\nEach group follows the established `prefix:method` naming convention and slots into the existing section ordering, with tree view inserted between language and SCM sections.",
			"SHA": "1c08f747580d9b75cb0725731419573f7fffcc20"
		},
