				2
			],
			"Message": "style(Common): Apply badge table wrapper and em-quad headings to doc set\n\nAdd the project-wide GitHub badge table wrapper (dark/light-aware Land logo picture element) and em-quad spaced headings to both Architecture.md and DeepDive.md, matching the formatting convention established in the crate README.\n\nArchitecture.md receives the full table wrapper with the \"Common Architecture\" em-quad heading, replacing the plain markdown title. DeepDive.md is already staged with its badge wrapper; this diff polishes its opening prose — shifting from \"This document provides...\" to \"**Common** provides...\" for a tighter, subject-led sentence and updating \"ecosystem\" to \"platform\" for precise project terminology.\n\nBoth documents now share consistent visual formatting with the main README, improving cohesion across the Common documentation set.",
			"SHA": "5ed8dd4f6bcf345461a411b24828531a9582f6f7"
